{
  "_comment": [
    "HAND-CALCULATED statutory fee fixtures (plan 8.4 / gate 11.2).",
    "Every value below was worked out by hand from the broker schedule effective",
    "date and reconciled against the implementation to the last decimal place.",
    "All amounts are INR strings so the test compares exact Decimal values.",
    "",
    "Rules used, per executed leg, on turnover T:",
    "  brokerage        = min(0.03% * T, 20.00)",
    "  stt              = 0.025% * T on the SELL side only (equity intraday)",
    "  exchange (NSE)   = 0.0030699% * T per side",
    "  sebi             = 10 * T / 1e7",
    "  stamp duty       = BUY only, min(0.003% * T, 300 * T / 1e7)",
    "  gst              = 18% * (brokerage + sebi + exchange + IPFT)",
    "  ipft             = 0.01 * T / 1e7 by default under the public FYERS schedule",
    "",
    "Note: 300 per crore is exactly 0.003%, so the stamp-duty lower-of form ties",
    "at every notional; it is still asserted so a future rate change is caught."
  ],
